  - m_Id: 1086959618
    m_Localized: Your Color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153920
    m_Localized: Swap Buff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153921
    m_Localized: Solo Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153922
    m_Localized: 'Shout your own name to activate your buff.

      Press E to set
      your nickname.

      Make sure to test it out!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153923
    m_Localized: Team Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153924
    m_Localized: "When the warning icon appears, shout your team's cheer word together.\nIt
      undoes whatever threat the mouth or esophagus just made.\nOnly the host can
      set the team cheer word \u2014 talk it over with your team first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153925
    m_Localized: Cheer Name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153926
    m_Localized: "Cheer names can only be typed in English.\nReal words you'd actually
      say out loud work best!\nNo mic, or voice recognition not working? Turn on
      number-key cheering from the ESC menu.\n(1 = solo cheer, 2 = team cheer \u2014
      but voice is way more fun!)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153927
    m_Localized: Team Cheer Practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153928
    m_Localized: "Press [E] to trigger a mock threat warning \u2014\nthe mouth above
      will close.\nShout your team's cheer word together to open it back up.\nA heart
      appears over the head of whoever shouted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153929
    m_Localized: Time to Start the Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153930
    m_Localized: 'The start zone is on the yellow floor.

      Once the whole team
      gathers there, a countdown begins and the game starts.

      Your cheer name
      locks in the moment the countdown ends,

      so make sure everyone''s done
      choosing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992255946752
    m_Localized: Choose your cheer name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992293695488
    m_Localized: "These won't work\n\xB7 Profanity/blocked words (e.g. fuck)\n\xB7
      Reserved words (admin, host, cheer)\n\xB7 Numbers, underscores (_), Korean,
      emojis, single letters\n\xB7 2\u201312 characters, lowercase English letters
      only\n\nAfter confirming, make sure to test if it's actually recognized!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889792
    m_Localized: ex) happy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889793
    m_Localized: ex) fighting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889794
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889795
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889796
    m_Localized: 'Set the word your whole team will shout together (default: FIGHTING)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889797
    m_Localized: 'Team keyword: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647744
    m_Localized: "Use 2\u201312 lowercase English letters only."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647745
    m_Localized: That name is a reserved system word, so you can't use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647746
    m_Localized: That word is a reserved system word, so you can't use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647747
    m_Localized: This contains a word that can't be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647748
    m_Localized: Another teammate is already using that name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647749
    m_Localized: A teammate is already using that as their cheer name.
    m_Metadata:
